# The manifest hashes the bytes Git stores, which are LF. Without this, a clone with
# core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF and every text digest in results/MANIFEST.md mismatches
# for a reason that has nothing to do with the measurements.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.gz binary

# Hashed by results/package2/FREEZE.json as written (CRLF); stored byte for byte so the freeze verifies in a clone.
results/package2/certificates.json -text
